# Jak II, 0.1.8 (LIST-0.1.8 item 5, a tester: "i miss being able to hold gun while drivng"). Run with
# JAKVR_TEST_CONTINUE=ctysluma-start JAKVR_TEST_GUN=1 JAKVR_TEST_WARP=bikea JAKVR_TEST_RIDE=1 QUEST_SIM_ALIGN=10000
# JAKVR_STATE_TRACE=1
# JAKVR_BODY_TRACE=1: in Haven City with the guns given, Jak put and kept 2 m from the nearest city bike (frame 10000),
